    "synopsis": {
        "native": "\u00c0 l\u2019aube du XIIIe si\u00e8cle en Italie, la vie simple et fraternelle de Fran\u00e7ois d\u2019Assise aupr\u00e8s des plus d\u00e9munis fascine et d\u00e9range la puissante \u00c9glise. Entour\u00e9 de ses fr\u00e8res, port\u00e9 par une foi intense, il lutte pour faire reconna\u00eetre sa vision d\u2019un monde de paix et d\u2019\u00e9galit\u00e9.",
        "english": "At the dawn of the thirteenth century in Italy, the simple and fraternal life of Francis of Assisi amongst the most impoverished fascinates and troubles the powerful Church. Surrounding by his brother monks, borne along by intense faith, he struggles to impose his vision of a world of peace and equality."
